OL,3,APrimark finally set to launch home
OL,4,Adeliveries
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe company said there was "opportunity
OL,7,Ffor profitable growth" through home
OL,8,Fdeliveries, which could help boost
OL,9,Ftrade after Primark reported subdued
OL,10,Fsales following the recent hot weather.
